# Every name Nova's cursors answer to: a design (theme/cursor/src/<design>.svg)
# and then the names that ask for it. A name missing here falls through to
# another theme's cursor, or to the X server's own, so the list is all of
# them: the CSS names, which Wayland's cursor-shape protocol and GTK 4 ask
# for (with cursor-shape's dnd-ask and all-resize); the X11 cursor font's,
# which X11 apps, Java and SDL ask for; GTK 3's and Chromium's fallbacks (the
# dnd-* names, h_double_arrow); Qt's names and the hashes Qt and Mozilla ask
# for. Each is a link to its design in cursors/, and an override of it in
# Hyprcursor's. theme/cursor/build --check checks both have every one.

